### Profile Update Endpoint
PUT http://localhost:3052/v1/api/profile
Content-Type: application/json
x-client-id: <user_id from login>
authorization: <access_token from login>

{
  "name": "Natsu",
  "age": 21,
  "mobility_needs": "Wheelchair",
  "heat_uv_sensitivity": "High",
  "max_stairs_per_route": 10,
  "preferred_pace": "Slow"
}